I needed Carry On to support being able to pick up blocks from Valkyrien Skies ships for my modpack. At first I though I'd just fork the project, find out which commit the 1.20.1 release is from and work from there. But the build scripts are just horribly broken, which to be fair has always been my experience with Gradle. I wasted half a day trying my best to make it work, and today just ended up making a [mixin mod](https://github.com/copygirl/carryon-vs-compat) to satisfy my needs.

**edit:** Fix is actually much simpler than I originally thought, see comment below.

<details>
<summary>Original issue text</summary>
However, I wanted to offer my work so it may be included. Based on the [`GamestageCompat` class](https://github.com/Tschipp/CarryOn/blob/67db9798d8c24c2bc649f0d8ee2b9ade62544678/Forge/src/main/java/tschipp/carryon/compat/GamestageCompat.java) I've made a similar class that would allow Carry On to measure distance while considering Valkyrien Skies ships as well:

```java
public class ValkyrienSkiesCompat {
    private static Method squaredDistanceToInclShips;

    static {
        try {
            Class<?> clazz = Class.forName("org.valkyrienskies.mod.common.VSGameUtilsKt");
            squaredDistanceToInclShips = clazz.getMethod("squaredDistanceToInclShips",
                Entity.class, Double.class, Double.class, Double.class);
        } catch (Exception e) {
            Constants.LOG.info("Valkyrien Skies not found. Disabling.");
        }
    }

    public static double distance(Player player, Vec3 pos) {
        if (squaredDistanceToInclShips != null) {
            try { return Math.sqrt((double)squaredDistanceToInclShips.invoke(player, pos.x, pos.y, pos.z)); }
            catch (IllegalAccessException | InvocationTargetException e) { squaredDistanceToInclShips = null; }
        }
        return player.position().distanceTo(pos);
    }
}
```

This would simply replace [the call to `distanceTo` in `PickupHandler`](https://github.com/Tschipp/CarryOn/blob/67db9798d8c24c2bc649f0d8ee2b9ade62544678/Common/src/main/java/tschipp/carryon/common/carry/PickupHandler.java#L63).
As I've been unable to compile the mod, I can't verify whether the code works.
I was able to test the mixin mod successfully, though.
</details>

Thank you for considering.

